["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Someone took you hunting. One day you take someone else. Do it legally, safely, and so they want to come back.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout warn\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three roads in for a new BC hunter. CORE course: about 21 hours of self study and handling practice, proof needed for most licences, a 30 dollar graduate fee plus exam fees to verify. Initiation licence: 18 or older, never held a BC hunting licence, once in a lifetime, 19 dollars, supervised at all times. Youth licence: age 10 to under 18, a parent applies, 7 dollars, supervised by an adult, and the take counts against the supervisor&#x27;s bag limit. Synopsis pages 5, 6 and 8. No one under 10 may hunt.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Three roads in for a new hunter</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"44\" width=\"124\" height=\"322\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"44\" width=\"124\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CORE course</text><g transform=\"translate(70 128) scale(1.2)\"><path d=\"M0 -12 Q-10 -18 -20 -14 V16 Q-10 12 0 18 Q10 12 20 16 V-14 Q10 -18 0 -12 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 -12 V18\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"70\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">About 21 hours</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"193\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">of study</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Proof needed</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"237\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">for most</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">licences</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"281\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$30 graduate</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">fee</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Exam fees:</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">VERIFY</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"44\" width=\"124\" height=\"322\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"138\" y=\"44\" width=\"124\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Initiation</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">licence</text><g transform=\"translate(200 128) scale(1.2)\"><circle cx=\"-9\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 16 V2 Q-9 -5 0 2 V16 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M1 18 V4 Q10 -3 19 4 V18 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18 or older</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"203\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Never held a BC</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">licence</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"247\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Once in a</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lifetime, $19</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"291\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Supervised at</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">all times</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"44\" width=\"124\" height=\"322\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"44\" width=\"124\" height=\"52\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Youth licence</text><g transform=\"translate(330 128) scale(1.2)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-10 18 V2 Q0 -6 10 2 V18 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><text x=\"330\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Age 10 to under</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"193\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Parent applies,</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"237\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">$7</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Supervised by</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"281\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">an adult</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Take counts on</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"325\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">supervisor</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"388\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Synopsis pages 5, 6 and 8, 99%. No one under 10 may hunt.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Safety first, then the law, then the hunt (Tip).</li><li>Assumption: you mentor only after you meet the supervisor rules.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the three roads in words</summary><ul><li>Three roads in for a new BC hunter: <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"CORE\">CORE</button> (Conservation and Outdoor Recreation Education), the initiation licence, or the youth licence (99%, synopsis pages 5 and 6).</li><li>Safety first, then the law, then the hunt (Tip).</li><li>Assumption: you will mentor only after you meet the supervisor rules below. As a new hunter, that is a few seasons away.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 616\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Licence path in order. 1, CORE hunter safety course, about 21 hours, needed for most licences. 2, FWID in WILD, free, age 10 or older, one per hunter. 3, prove BC residency, renewed every three years. 4, resident hunting licence, 32 dollars or 7 dollars at 65 or older, electronic. 5, a species licence for each animal that needs one, deer 15 dollars, mailed if bought online, right away in person. 6, LEH draw, only for Limited Entry Hunting seasons. 7, for ducks or geese the federal bird permit, 17 dollars. Carry photo ID, your FWID number and every species licence, used or not.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"616\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">What to get, in order</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"46\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"74\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"79.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">CORE hunter safety course</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">About 21 hours. Needed for most licences</text>\n<line x1=\"36\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"36.0\" y2=\"110.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"36,116 31.7,107.0 40.3,107.0\" fill=\"#23261f\"/>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"116\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"144\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"149.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">FWID in WILD</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Free. Age 10 or older. One per hunter</text>\n<line x1=\"36\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"36.0\" y2=\"180.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"36,186 31.7,177.0 40.3,177.0\" fill=\"#23261f\"/>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"186\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"214\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"219.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Prove BC residency</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Renew every three years</text>\n<line x1=\"36\" y1=\"242\" x2=\"36.0\" y2=\"250.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"36,256 31.7,247.0 40.3,247.0\" fill=\"#23261f\"/>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"256\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"284\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"289.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Resident hunting licence</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">$32 ($7 at 65 or older). Electronic</text>\n<line x1=\"36\" y1=\"312\" x2=\"36.0\" y2=\"320.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"36,326 31.7,317.0 40.3,317.0\" fill=\"#23261f\"/>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"326\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"354\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"359.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Species licence per animal</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Deer $15. Online: mailed. In person: now</text>\n<line x1=\"36\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"36.0\" y2=\"390.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"36,396 31.7,387.0 40.3,387.0\" fill=\"#23261f\"/>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"396\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"424\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"429.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">LEH draw</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"440\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Only for Limited Entry Hunting seasons</text>\n<line x1=\"36\" y1=\"452\" x2=\"36.0\" y2=\"460.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"36,466 31.7,457.0 40.3,457.0\" fill=\"#23261f\"/>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"466\" width=\"380\" height=\"56\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"494\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"499.25\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">7</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"490\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks or geese?</text>\n<text x=\"62\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Federal bird permit, $17</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"536\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"562\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Carry: photo ID, FWID number,</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"584\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">every species licence (used or not)</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>CORE (Conservation and Outdoor Recreation Education): about 21 hours. Proof is needed for most licences <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: CORE in full</summary><ul><li>CORE has run since 1974. The BC Wildlife Federation (BCWF) delivers it (99%, synopsis page 5).</li><li>Exam topics: outdoor ethics, firearm handling, hunting regulations, animal and bird ID (identification), outdoor survival, first aid and safety, hunter heritage, conservation and wildlife management (99%, page 5).</li><li>About 21 hours of self study and firearm handling practice (99%, page 5).</li><li>Classroom instruction is not compulsory but is recommended (99%, page 5).</li><li>Fees for each exam, plus a $30.00 graduate fee to BCWF (99%, page 5). Exam fee amounts: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> with BCWF.</li><li>Proof of hunter safety training, such as a CORE certificate, is required to buy most hunting licences (99%, page 5).</li><li>BCWF: <a href=\"https://bcwf.bc.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bcwf.bc.ca</a>, 1 888 881 2293 (99%, page 5).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"One supervising hunter may supervise at most two youth licence hunters, or two initiation licence hunters, or one of each. Youth who hold a basic hunting licence do not count toward that maximum. Animals taken under youth or initiation licences count in the supervising adult&#x27;s bag limit.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"360\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">One supervisor, at most:</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"380\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(50 90) scale(1.3)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(110 92) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(150 92) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/></g>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">2 youth</text>\n<text x=\"370\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">or</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"122\" width=\"380\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(50 168) scale(1.3)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(110 170) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(150 170) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">2 initiation</text>\n<text x=\"370\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">or</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"200\" width=\"380\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(50 246) scale(1.3)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g>\n<g transform=\"translate(110 248) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(150 248) scale(1.0)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-16\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><path d=\"M-8 -6 L8 -6 L6 14 L-6 14 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">1 of each</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Youth with a basic hunting licence do not count.</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"321\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Their animals count in the adult&#x27;s bag limit.</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"346\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Orange: youth licence. Blue: initiation licence.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Once in a lifetime, 18 or older, $19, supervised at all times <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>The supervisor signs a form before each day <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the initiation licence in full</summary><aside class=\"callout law\"><div class=\"callout-t\">The rule</div><p>\"An Initiation Hunting Licence is a once in a lifetime annual licence that can only be issued to a person who is a B.C. resident, is 18 years of age or older, and has not held a B.C. hunting licence in the past (with the exception of a youth or junior licence).\" (99%, synopsis page 6)</p></aside><ul><li>Fee: $19.00 (99%, page 8).</li><li>No hunter safety training needed to get it (99%, page 6).</li><li>The new hunter must be with a supervising hunter at all times (99%, page 6).</li><li>Before each day of hunting, the supervisor signs a form acknowledging the supervision conditions. Forms at <a href=\"https://www.gov.bc.ca/hunting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">gov.bc.ca/hunting</a> (99%, page 6).</li><li>No personal <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Bag limit\">Bag limit</button>. Anything taken counts against the supervisor's bag limit (99%, page 6).</li><li>No species licences can be bought with it (99%, page 6).</li><li>Tip: it is a try before you commit licence. Push them to start CORE the same year.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 218\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Age bar. Under 10: no hunting, and letting a child under 10 hunt is an offence. Age 10 to 17: youth licence. 18 and up: an initiation licence once in a lifetime, or CORE and a basic licence.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"218\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Age and the licence</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#9aa3ad\"/><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Under 10</text><text x=\"80.0\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No hunting</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"60\" width=\"96\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"188.0\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 to 17</text><text x=\"188.0\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Youth</text><text x=\"188.0\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">licence</text><rect x=\"236\" y=\"60\" width=\"144\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"308.0\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18 and up</text><text x=\"308.0\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Initiation or CORE</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"236\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Letting a child under 10 hunt is an offence (99%).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Ages 10 to under 18. Always with an adult who meets the supervisor rules <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the youth licence in full</summary><ul><li>For ages 10 to under 18, with a FWID (Fish and Wildlife ID). Youth may hold a regular hunting licence or a youth licence (99%, page 6).</li><li>A parent or guardian applies for it on the youth's behalf and signs an undertaking about supervision (99%, pages 6 and 8).</li><li>Fee: $7.00 (99%, page 8).</li><li>No hunter safety training needed to get it (99%, page 6).</li><li>Every youth hunter, trained or not, on either licence, must be \"accompanied and under the close personal supervision of an adult\" who meets the supervisor rules (99%, page 6).</li><li>No personal bag limit on a youth licence. The take counts against the supervisor's (99%, page 6). In an LEH (Limited Entry Hunting) season, a resident youth may hunt with an adult who holds the LEH authorization and species licence (99%, page 6).</li><li>No one under 10 may hunt. Letting them is an offence (99%, page 6).</li><li>Region 3 has youth only seasons, for hunters under 18, including mule deer bucks 1 to 9 September in listed MUs (Management Units), and white tailed deer either sex 1 to 30 November (99%, synopsis page 34).</li><li>Ducks and geese: youth and their supervisors carry provincial licences plus the federal permit. The youth permit is sold only through the federal online permit system (99%, page 7).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 345\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Can I supervise? Check each: a FWID with active residency and hunting credentials; a hunting licence, not an initiation licence, in at least 3 earlier licence years, in BC or elsewhere; not prohibited from having a firearm anywhere; no more than two youth, two initiation, or one of each with you. All yes: you may supervise. For an initiation hunter you also hold a basic hunting licence. Synopsis page 6.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"345\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Can I supervise? (page 6)</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"46\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">FWID with residency and hunting credentials?</text><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"98.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M196.5 90.8 L200.0 98.0 L203.5 90.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"100\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hunting licence in 3 earlier licence years?</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not an initiation licence. BC or elsewhere</text><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"165.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M196.5 157.8 L200.0 165.0 L203.5 157.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"167\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not prohibited from having a firearm?</text><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"203\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"219.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M196.5 211.8 L200.0 219.0 L203.5 211.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"221\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"243\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Two new hunters or fewer with you?</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"261\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Two youth, two initiation, or one of each</text><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"286.0\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M196.5 278.8 L200.0 286.0 L203.5 278.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"288\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fde8d8\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">All yes: you may supervise</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"328\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Initiation: you also hold a basic licence</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Check your brother's licence years in WILD (Wildlife Information and Licensing Data) first (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the law in full</summary><aside class=\"callout law\"><div class=\"callout-t\">The rule</div><p>The supervisor must (99%, synopsis page 6):</p><ul><li>Hold a FWID with active residency and hunting credentials.</li><li>For an initiation hunter: be a resident with a basic hunting licence (unless exempt).</li><li>Have held a hunting licence, not an initiation licence, in BC or elsewhere, in at least 3 of the licence years before this one.</li><li>Not be prohibited from having a firearm anywhere.</li><li>Supervise no more than two youth, two initiation, or one of each at a time. Youth on a basic licence do not count.</li></ul></aside><ul><li>Your brother can supervise only if he meets every line above (Tip: check his licence years in WILD (Wildlife Information and Licensing Data) before you plan it).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: a new hunter walks in front on a trail and the mentor follows behind. The mentor carries no rifle and can see the new hunter&#x27;s muzzle, held up, the mentor decides when the firearm is loaded, and both unload at every fence and creek crossing. Tip, plus the law on loaded firearms in vehicles.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" opacity=\".5\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Walk single file, new hunter in front</text><path id=\"lc-mt-single-file-path\" d=\"M30 240 C120 230 180 160 260 150 S 360 120 380 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c9b79c\" stroke-width=\"22\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g><g transform=\"scale(1.1)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-10 18 V2 Q0 -6 10 2 V18 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/></g><path d=\"M8 -2 L12 -34\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">New hunter</text><animateMotion dur=\"7s\" fill=\"freeze\" keyPoints=\"0.16;0.72\" keyTimes=\"0;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"><mpath href=\"#lc-mt-single-file-path\"/></animateMotion></g><g><g transform=\"scale(1.1)\"><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-10 18 V2 Q0 -6 10 2 V18 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/></g><text x=\"0\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mentor</text><animateMotion dur=\"7s\" fill=\"freeze\" keyPoints=\"0;0.54\" keyTimes=\"0;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"><mpath href=\"#lc-mt-single-file-path\"/></animateMotion></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"52\" width=\"220\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mentor sees the muzzle</text></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"5.5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"88\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"146\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mentor says when to load</text></g><g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"124\" width=\"300\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"166\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Unload at every fence and creek</text></g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>New hunter in front, where you can see the muzzle. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>The mentor decides when the firearm is loaded (Tip).</li><li>No loaded firearm in or on a vehicle (99%, synopsis page 11).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full safety list</summary><ul><li>Before the first hunt, a range day: <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ACTS\">ACTS</button> and <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"PROVE\">PROVE</button> until it is automatic (Tip).</li><li>Rule one on the day: the mentor controls when the firearm is loaded (Tip).</li><li>Walk single file, new hunter in front where you can see the muzzle (Tip).</li><li>Agree <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Zone of fire\">Zone of fire</button> before every setup, out loud (Tip).</li><li>Unloaded at every fence, vehicle and creek crossing (Tip). No loaded firearm in or on a vehicle (99%, synopsis page 11).</li><li>Blaze orange on both of you for the walk in and out (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 430\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What a good mentor does. Do: plan a short first day, warm, fed, home early. Do: explain why, about wind, glassing and shot angle. Do: back every no shot decision. Do: hand them the knife at the gut pile and stay beside them. Do: share the meat and the credit. Do: call a week later and invite them again. Do not: take three new hunters at once, the limit is two. Do not: a 12 hour cold first day with no explanations.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"430\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A good mentor (Tip)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 78) scale(0.9)\"><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><line x1=\"13.0\" y1=\"0.0\" x2=\"19.0\" y2=\"0.0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"9.2\" y1=\"9.2\" x2=\"13.4\" y2=\"13.4\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"0.0\" y1=\"13.0\" x2=\"0.0\" y2=\"19.0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"-9.2\" y1=\"9.2\" x2=\"-13.4\" y2=\"13.4\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"-13.0\" y1=\"0.0\" x2=\"-19.0\" y2=\"0.0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"-9.2\" y1=\"-9.2\" x2=\"-13.4\" y2=\"-13.4\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"-0.0\" y1=\"-13.0\" x2=\"-0.0\" y2=\"-19.0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"9.2\" y1=\"-9.2\" x2=\"13.4\" y2=\"-13.4\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><circle cx=\"179\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M173 60 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Short first</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">day: warm,</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">fed, home</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">early</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"44\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 78) scale(0.9)\"><path d=\"M-20 -14 H20 V8 H-2 L-12 18 V8 H-20 Z\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-12 -6 H12 M-12 1 H6\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></g><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"60\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M366 60 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"261\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Explain why:</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">wind,</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">glassing,</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">angle</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"140\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 174) scale(0.9)\"><circle r=\"18\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-7 -7 l14 14 M7 -7 l-14 14\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><circle cx=\"179\" cy=\"156\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M173 156 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Back every</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">&quot;no shot&quot;</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"140\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 174) scale(0.9)\"><path d=\"M-20 6 L6 -4 Q16 -8 20 -12 Q18 2 6 6 Z\" fill=\"#cfd6bf\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-24\" y=\"2\" width=\"14\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\" transform=\"rotate(-20 -17 6)\"/></g><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"156\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M366 156 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"261\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Hand them</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">the knife,</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">stay beside</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"236\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 270) scale(0.9)\"><path d=\"M-18 -4 Q-14 -18 6 -14 Q22 -10 18 6 Q12 18 -6 14 Q-20 10 -18 -4 Z\" fill=\"#c0504d\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-8 -2 Q2 -8 10 0\" stroke=\"#f5e0d8\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#f5f0e0\"/></g><circle cx=\"179\" cy=\"252\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M173 252 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Share the</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">meat and the</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">credit</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"236\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 270) scale(0.9)\"><rect x=\"-10\" y=\"-18\" width=\"20\" height=\"36\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"-7\" y=\"-13\" width=\"14\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#dbe7f2\"/><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#fff\"/></g><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"252\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M366 252 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"261\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Call a week</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">later,</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">invite again</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"332\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 366) scale(0.9)\"><circle cx=\"-9\" cy=\"-10\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 16 V2 Q-9 -5 0 2 V16 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"-8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M1 18 V4 Q10 -3 19 4 V18 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/></g><circle cx=\"179\" cy=\"348\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M174 343 l10 10 M184 343 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Take three</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">at once:</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"392\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">limit is two</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"332\" width=\"185\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(233 366) scale(0.9)\"><circle r=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 0 V-11 M0 0 L8 5\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"348\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M367 343 l10 10 M377 343 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"261\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">12 hour cold</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">day, no</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"392\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">explanations</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>\"Be aware that you are a mentor when youth are observing.\" (99%, page 77)</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full list</summary><ul><li>Plans a short first day: warm, fed, home before they are miserable (Tip).</li><li>Explains why, not just what: wind, glassing, shot angle (Tip).</li><li>Lets them make the shot decision, and backs a \"no shot\" every time (Tip).</li><li>Hands them the knife at the gut pile, with you beside them (Tip).</li><li>Shares the meat and the credit (Tip).</li><li>Models the ethics code: \"Be aware that you are a mentor when youth are observing.\" (99%, synopsis page 77)</li><li>Follows up: a phone call a week later, and an invite to the next trip (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Their first hunt is not your hunt. Carry the coffee, not the rifle.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Supervising before you have the 3 licence years. It is not a formality, it is the law.</li><li>Taking three new hunters at once. The limit is two.</li><li>A first day that is 12 hours, cold, and ends with no explanation of anything.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Write a one page plan for a future first hunt: the licence path, the safety talk, the spot, the turn back time, and who signs the initiation form.</p></aside>","<ul><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly, checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>:<ul><li>Page 5: CORE, BCWF, proof of hunter safety training.</li><li>Page 6: initiation licence, youth licence, supervision, supervisor qualifications, under 10 rule.</li><li>Page 7: migratory bird permits for youth. Page 8: licence fees, parent undertaking.</li><li>Page 11: loaded firearms and vehicles. Page 34: Region 3 youth only seasons. Page 77: ethics code.</li></ul></li><li><a href=\"https://bcwf.bc.ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Wildlife Federation</a>, address and phone number as printed in the synopsis, page 5.</li><li>Mentoring habits: Hunt Mentor opinion, labelled Tip.</li></ul>"]